3ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch of the AmbientScreen 1.5 and why is it important?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe AmbientScreen 1.5 features a 1.5mm pixel pitch, ensuring extremely sharp and detailed images ideal for close viewing distances typical in home cinema settings. Smaller pixel pitch means higher resolution and smoother visuals.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does the adjustable brightness affect viewing experience?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWith brightness adjustable from 50 to 600 nits, the AmbientScreen 1.5 adapts to different lighting conditions, providing optimal picture clarity during both daytime and nighttime viewing. This feature helps reduce eye strain and maintain vivid colors.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat are the installation requirements for the AmbientScreen 1.5?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe screen has an ultra-slim 32mm depth for flush wall mounting, requiring a flat and sturdy wall surface. Professional installation is recommended to ensure precise alignment and secure mounting without compromising the sleek profile.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does AmbientScreen 1.5 compare to traditional projectors?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eUnlike projectors, AmbientScreen delivers consistent brightness and sharp 4K UHD resolution without needing a dark room or reflective screen. It also doubles as ambient art, whereas projectors only serve viewing purposes.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"AmbientScreen 1.5 - High-Quality Ambient LED Display Dubai | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Enhance spaces with A