ext\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the AmbientScreen 1.5 and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The AmbientScreen 1.5 features a 1.5mm pixel pitch, ensuring extremely sharp and detailed images ideal for close viewing distances typical in home cinema settings. Smaller pixel pitch means higher resolution and smoother visuals.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the adjustable brightness affect viewing experience?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With brightness adjustable from 50 to 600 nits, the AmbientScreen 1.5 adapts to different lighting conditions, providing optimal picture clarity during both daytime and nighttime viewing. This feature helps reduce eye strain and maintain vivid colors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for the AmbientScreen 1.5?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The screen has an ultra-slim 32mm depth for flush wall mounting, requiring a flat and sturdy wall surface. Professional installation is recommended to ensure precise alignment and secure mounting without compromising the sleek profile.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does AmbientScreen 1.5 compare to traditional projectors?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike projectors, AmbientScreen delivers consistent brightness and sharp 4K UHD resolution without needing a dark room or reflective screen. It also doubles as ambient art, whereas projectors only serve viewing purposes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support does Brightluxx offer for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a comprehensive 3-year warranty covering parts and labor, along with dedicated local support in the UAE and GCC region. Optional extended warranty plans are available upon purchase.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the AmbientScreen 1.5 display standard HD content effectively?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the built-in AI upscaling enhances HD and lower-resolution content to near-4K quality, ensuring clear and vibrant images regardless of the original content resolution.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the AmbientScreen 1.5 suitable for multi-purpose rooms like family rooms?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. Its dual-mode operation allows seamless switching between cinematic viewing and displaying ambient artwork, making it perfect for family rooms where aesthetics and entertainment coexist.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What sizes are available and how do I choose the right one?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sizes range from 85\\\" to 136\\\" diagonally. Choosing depends on room size, viewing distance, and personal preference, with larger screens offering more immersive cinema experiences in spacious areas.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Lis