rs?</h3><p>Unlike projectors, AmbientScreen delivers consistent brightness and sharp 4K UHD resolution without needing a dark room or reflective screen. It also doubles as ambient art, whereas projectors only serve viewing purposes.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"AmbientScreen 1.5 - High-Quality Ambient LED Display Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Enhance spaces with AmbientScreen 1.5 ambient LED displays in Dubai. Order from Brightluxx UAE and transform your environment now!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/ambientscreen-15\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{}]}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\",\"async\":true}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{}],\"notFound\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"not-found\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"children\":\"404 — Page Not Found\"}],[\"$\",\"